      "title": "Add receipt download endpoint",
      "description": "Customers want to download a receipt for an order (SHOP-123).\n\nAdds `GET /orders/:id/receipt`, which renders a plain-text receipt for one of the user's orders. Receipts are cached for an hour, configurable in `config/app.yaml`.",
